# Keeps the container build context small and free of local state (the Rust target/ dir alone is ~1 GB).
# Root-level on purpose: the docker-compose provider behind `podman compose` ignores Containerfile.dockerignore.
**/node_modules
.git
**/dist
**/target
**/.turbo
**/coverage
test-results
tests/.tmp
crates
design
apps/desktop
tests/e2e
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
